OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry but rather cloudy in
OL,6,Fthe morning with just a few light
OL,7,Fshowers, these mainly across the
OL,8,FSouthern Uplands. Becoming mainly dry
OL,9,Fthrough the afternoon with increasing
OL,10,Fsunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAny remaining showers will
OL,13,Fquickly clear to leave a dry evening
OL,14,Fwith some sunny spells. The rest of
OL,15,Fthe night will then remain dry with
OL,16,Fclear periods. Turning rather chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
