OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA dry and bright morning with
OL,6,Fsunny intervals. Turning cloudier
OL,7,Fthrough the afternoon, with the chance
OL,8,Fof a few spots of rain during the
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,12,FBecoming unsettled from Monday, with
OL,13,Frain spreading northwards, at times
OL,14,Fheavy and persistent. Further spells
OL,15,Fof rain or showers are likely on
OL,16,FTuesday and Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
